cosmic-text variable outline scaling adaptation
==============================================

src/canvas/text_cache/glyphs/variable.rs adapts swash_outline_commands from
cosmic-text 0.15.0 src/swash.rs under its MIT license.
https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-text

